const bios=[
 ['The courier','A family reed carries a voice recorded after its owner died. Sable follows the impossible date into the city’s machinery.','Sable’s delivery brings the travellers to Rook’s workshop.','Rook · the promise at the workshop'],
 ['The river physician','Iona learns that a shelter is a promise people must be able to open for themselves. Her waterline becomes a warning the city cannot erase.','Iona brings Lowbank’s history to the festival before the prisoners need her.','Sable · a voice that needs a witness'],
 ['The maker','Rook’s first heating contract hides a voice intake. A small refusal leaves a way to stop the machine when its real purpose is revealed.','Rook reaches Sable as the maker who already knows the flaw inside the carrier.','Brass · the route a machine must leave open'],
 ['The unfinished guardian','Brass opens a crossing the railway never meant passengers to use. Protecting people begins with questioning an order.','Brass brings the rail quarter’s public promise to the gathering crew.','Iona · a platform wide enough for a stretcher'],
 ['The river witness','Riven finds that equal water on a charter can mean empty cups downstream. Two keys change who can answer when one bank falls silent.','Riven carries the river’s divided history into the city’s shared destination.','Veyr · learning when to listen'],
 ['The keeper of margins','Mira discovers that a register counts recordings while its discarded scraps count people. She must protect a name without surrendering its owner.','Mira reaches the crew with evidence that an erased voice still leaves pressure in clay.','Sable · the missing date in the register'],
 ['The listener','Veyr’s mast hears a distant operator called interference. Leaving room for an answer becomes more powerful than another broadcast.','Veyr brings the first unanswered signal down from the observatory.','Riven · quiet stations and the same tide']
];
const openingHooks=['Follow a voice through a broken relay.','Get a flooded shelter open.','Stop a heater that records its workers.'];
const el=(tag,cls,text)=>{const n=document.createElement(tag);if(cls)n.className=cls;if(text!==undefined)n.textContent=text;return n;};
